      "title": {
        "en": "Pamiątki z Krakowa"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A present from Poland is often a souvenir, *pamiątka*: *srebrna biżuteria z bursztynem* (silver jewellery with amber), Polish honey, *miód*, or a CD of Polish music. From the mountains comes *oscypek*, a smoked sheep cheese; *obwarzanek* is a ring of bread sold on the streets of *Kraków*; and in winter people drink *grzaniec*, mulled wine."
      }
    }
  ],
